    "title": "【观点】申银万国：纳斯达克指数上涨趋势明显 建议做多",
    "time": "05月14日 09:16",
    "url": "http://goodsfu.10jqka.com.cn/20260514/c676680477.shtml",
    "slug": "【观点】申银万国：纳斯达克指数上涨趋势明显 建议做多_339cd45398",
    "date": "20260514",
    "raw_file": "raw/20260514/【观点】申银万国：纳斯达克指数上涨趋势明显 建议做多_339cd45398.html",
    "site_file": "articles/20260514/【观点】申银万国：纳斯达克指数上涨趋势明显 建议做多_339cd45398.html",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"news-content article-content\" id=\"\" style=\"position:relative\"><div class=\"news-content-parsed\"><p>股指：美国<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://stockpage.10jqka.com.cn/NDAQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">纳斯达克（NDAQ）</a></span>指数再度上涨，上一交易日股指再度上涨，电子板块领涨，<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/881153\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">房地产（881153）</a></span>板块领跌，市场成交额3.26万亿元。资金方面，5月12日融资余额增加168.28亿元至28298.64亿元。A股<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/881121\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">半导体（881121）</a></span>、AI 算力、<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/886042\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">存储芯片（886042）</a></span>等硬科技赛道爆发，<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://stockpage.10jqka.com.cn/1B0819\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">有色金属（1B0819）</a></span>同步走强，政策流动性宽松与科创再贷款扩容预期共振，资金聚焦高景气硬科技与资源龙头，市场从结构性抱团转向全面活跃。A股一季度科创板业绩表现亮眼，AI算力、<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/884229\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">半导体设备（884229）</a></span>、<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/886009\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">先进封装（886009）</a></span>、<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/886042\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">存储芯片（886042）</a></span>等领域企业也纷纷兑现业绩，形成“算力-设备-材料-封测”的正向循环，共同支撑板块上行。我们认为当前市场多头趋势明显，操作上建议做多为主。</p></div></div>",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-14T09:20:28.158646+08:00"
  },
  {
    "title": "【观点】正信期货研究院：玉米期货短期震荡长期上行压力仍存",
    "time": "05月14日 09:17",
    "url": "http://goodsfu.10jqka.com.cn/20260514/c676680492.shtml",
    "slug": "【观点】正信期货研究院：玉米期货短期震荡长期上行压力仍存_9740969d9e",
    "date": "20260514",
    "raw_file": "raw/20260514/【观点】正信期货研究院：玉米期货短期震荡长期上行压力仍存_9740969d9e.html",
    "site_file": "articles/20260514/【观点】正信期货研究院：玉米期货短期震荡长期上行压力仍存_9740969d9e.html",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"news-content article-content\" id=\"\" style=\"position:relative\"><div class=\"news-content-parsed\"><p>外盘方面，USDA5月供需报告整体利多，美<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>震荡偏强。报告预计2026/27年度美国<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>期末库存为19.57亿蒲式耳，较2025/26年度下降1.85亿蒲式耳，但较预期高出约3,500万蒲式耳。美国产量预计为159.95亿蒲式耳，较今年的170.21亿蒲式耳下降6%。出口预计将下降1.50亿蒲式耳至31.5亿蒲式耳。</p><p>国内方面，<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>07合约震荡偏强。<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>基本面看，国内<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>市场购销逐步活跃，而随着气温回升，且农户存在回款需求，农户售粮进度加快，叠加小麦抛储替代，<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>现货上涨动能减弱。近期港口库存及下游企业库存有所回升，但总体仍处低位，对<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>形成支撑。</p><p>策略建议：当前国内港口及下游企业库存有所回升，市场购销逐步恢复，农户存在卖粮变现需求，上量逐步增加，小麦拍卖增量，替代效应增强，分流饲用<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>需求，叠加政策粮投放传闻扰动，压制<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>震荡走低；深加工<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>高成本，淀粉价格保持高位，同时市场对天气有担忧情绪，支撑<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>期价，短期<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>将延续窄幅震荡格局。中长期看，本年度<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>不存在产需缺口，而新季<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>还有种植面积增加预期，<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://q.10jqka.com.cn/thshy/detail/code/885811\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">玉米（885811）</a></span>价格上行存在压力。关注天气风险。</p></div></div>",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-14T09:20:28.291914+08:00"
  },
  {
    "title": "【观点】光大期货：美联储加息预期升温，原油短期依旧承压",
    "time": "05月14日 09:16",
    "url": "http://goodsfu.10jqka.com.cn/20260514/c676680460.shtml",
    "slug": "【观点】光大期货：美联储加息预期升温，原油短期依旧承压_2906eaad70",
    "date": "20260514",
    "raw_file": "raw/20260514/【观点】光大期货：美联储加息预期升温，原油短期依旧承压_2906eaad70.html",
    "site_file": "articles/20260514/【观点】光大期货：美联储加息预期升温，原油短期依旧承压_2906eaad70.html",
    "content_html": "<div class=\"news-content article-content\" id=\"\" style=\"position:relative\"><div class=\"news-content-parsed\"><p>周三油价下挫，其中WTI 6月合约收盘下跌1.16美元至101.02美元/桶，跌幅1.14%。布伦特7月合约收盘下跌2.14美元至105.63美元/桶，跌幅1.99%。SC2606以622.2元/桶收盘，下跌21.9元/桶，跌幅3.4%。美国4月份生产者价格录得四年来的最大涨幅，这是在与伊朗的战争期间通胀加速的最新迹象。4月份，<span><a class=\"link-wrapper link-blue\" href=\"https://fund.10jqka.com.cn/162415\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"word-break:break-all;cursor:pointer;color:#36F\" target=\"_blank\">美国消费（162415）</a></span>者价格连续第二个月大幅上涨，创下近三年来的最大同比增幅。如果通胀压力不减，美联储可能需要加息，这表明战争已开始对美国经济造成压力。油价上涨推高了燃料成本，经济学家预计未来几个月将看到其影响。EIA数据显示，截至5月8美国商业原油库存减少430万桶，至4.529亿桶，此前市场预期为减少210万桶。SPR减少860万桶至3.841亿桶。美国汽油库存减少410万桶至2.157亿桶，包括柴油和取暖油的馏分油库存增加20万桶至1.025亿桶。中美元首会晤，市场观望，同时在通胀爬高，加息预期上升的背景下，油价有所承压。</p><p></p><p></p><p></p></div></div>",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-14T09:20:28.294790+08:00"
  }
]